  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Rehabilitation and Maintenance Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PRF will finance the feasibility study including preparation of safeguard-related documents, and preparation of detailed engineering design and bidding documents for future pipeline projects included in COBP 2020-2022. The PRF itself is tailored to ensure the high project readiness of these ensuing projects, and thereby facilitate the timely and cost-effective achievement of the expected project outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
